  "kv1.7:18.1": "na vattabbaṃ ",
  "kv1.7:18.2": "atītānāgatā khandhā dhātu āyatanaṃ natthi ceteti. ",
  "kv1.7:18.3": "āmantā. ",
  "kv1.7:18.4": "nanu vuttaṃ bhagavatā ",
  "kv1.7:18.5": "tayome bhikkhave niruttipathā adhivacanapathā paññattipathā …pe… viññūhīti ",
