  "kv1.7:19.6": "yā kāci saññā …pe… ",
  "kv1.7:19.7": "ye keci saṅkhārā …pe… ",
  "kv1.7:19.8": "yaṃ kiñci viññāṇaṃ atītānāgatapaccuppannaṃ …pe… ",
  "kv1.7:19.9": "ayaṃ vuccati viññāṇakkhandhoti ",
